        "permissions": {
          "can_post_comments": true,
          "can_react": true,
          "can_share": true
        },
        "text": "Take the 60 seconds to read this and watch the short video.  As Malte Stryhn Pontoppidan Thomsen shared, this happens on a daily basis here.  We have had the pleasure of using this for the last 1-2 months here at ClickUp and I cannot imagine doing my job without it now.\n\nBrain² is our best release yet.",
