          "date": "3w",
          "parsed_datetime": "2026-06-29T11:06:56.679Z",
          "text": "A few weeks ago I was on a plane crossing the Atlantic. The video below was literally me.\n\nOne of my largest customers, a Group Director of Digital Transformation and close champion of ours, pinged me on WhatsApp requesting an urgent competitive analysis between ClickUp and a tool someone in his organisztion was evaluating, plus a presentation he could take to the C-Suite showcasing that ClickUp already had these capabilities natively, eliminating the need for another point product.\n\nBrain² came to the rescue:\n✅ In-depth comparison analysis generated as a ClickUp Document\n✅ Board-ready presentation created and shared with the customer\nAll with full historical context on the account. No code, no complex prompts, done in minutes, flying 10km above the ground.\n\nCheck it out here: clickup.com/brain",
          "author": {
            "public_identifier": "maltespthomsen",
            "id": "ACoAAA3XSFsBfuqiFh7VpesauSRiGc4e9N07WDU",
            "name": "Malte Stryhn Pontoppidan Thomsen",
            "is_company": false
          }
        }
