          "date": "3mo",
          "parsed_datetime": "2026-04-07T16:25:51.704Z",
          "text": "The hiring spree continues. 🔥\n\nEarlier today I posted about growing our Enterprise AE team, and I am not done. I am also looking for a Regional Director, Enterprise based in Chicago, IL to lead one of our fastest-growing regions.\n\nThis is a true player/coach role at a company that is rewriting the playbook on productivity software. You will be building and leading a team of Enterprise AEs, driving strategy across major accounts in the Midwest, and doing it at a company where the product actually makes your sellers' jobs easier (yes, we eat our own cooking 🍳).\n\nWhat I am looking for:\nSomeone who's built and scaled Enterprise teams before. Someone who gets fired up coaching reps through complex, multi-threaded deals. And someone who wants to be part of a leadership team that is genuinely obsessed with winning together.\n\nWhat's in it for you:\n📈 Equity\n🏥 Health, Dental & Vision\n👶 Paid parental leave\n🧘 Employee wellness stipend\n…and a lot more.\n\nIf you are a sales leader in Chicago (or willing to be), I want to hear from you. DMs are open. Tag someone who'd be perfect. 👇\n\n#Hiring #EnterpriseSales #SalesLeadership #ClickUp #Chicago #RegionalDirector #SaaS",
          "author": {
            "public_identifier": "benlevien",
            "id": "ACoAAANrr8UB4JJcFXnqcZSJK9atiAlf7djp7SQ",
            "name": "Ben Levien",
            "is_company": false
          }
        }
      },
      {
