          "can_react": true,
          "can_share": true
        },
        "text": "Hey everyone, I’m hiring in Dallas! \n\nI’ve got a couple openings on my Enterprise team at ClickUp, selling into some of the largest companies in the world.\n\nWe’re winning bigger and bigger, with AI leading the way, and we’re 2+ years ahead of a lot of the market with our agentic AI capabilities. Enterprise CIOs are picking ClickUp as their agentic platform of choice to transform how projects, products, and campaigns get delivered at scale.\n\nIf you’ve sold into big accounts, awesome. If you’re making a career change and you’ve got grit and love being coached, I’m open to taking a bet on the right person.\n\nIf this is you (or you know someone), DM me. This is for the DFW area only.",
