          "parsed_datetime": "2025-09-25T17:45:49.716Z",
          "text": "Last month, I told ClickUp's @Brain Agent to make a $200k decision for me.. And it did!\n\"Zeb, if we want to grab these NYC spots, we have to tell them today 🙏\" - Kyle Coleman\nSwipe to see what happened next →\n\n44 minutes. $200,000 decision.\n\nWould you let AI make a real business decision for you?",
