        "text": "Dan is the absolute best - proud to be a part of this!",
        "mentions": [],
        "attachments": [],
        "author": {
          "public_identifier": "christorbert",
          "id": "ACoAAAkcZs0BcrQPOIrLdT0I_BKDUWn2gANgRms",
          "name": "Chris Torbert",
          "is_company": false,
          "headline": "Sr. Director, Enterprise Sales @ ClickUp",
          "profile_picture_url": "https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D35AQHg9euoBFslqA/profile-framedphoto-shrink_200_200/B4DZ1Ok6wuH4AY-/0/1775139794323?e=1785510000&v=beta&t=UzrtKKdJEYjw-vMKGFR3wcXMsZ9jgfOVSIbf4l3T_SE"
        },
        "id": "7371203206246293504",
        "is_repost": true,
        "repost_id": "7371203206921572352",
        "parsed_datetime": "2025-09-09T15:29:54.702Z",
        "repost_content": {
          "id": "7371198099651977216",
          "date": "10mo",
          "parsed_datetime": "2025-09-09T15:09:37.195Z",
          "text": "not every day you get to say this…\n\nClickUp hit a milestone that once felt like a moonshot: $300M ARR. \n\nThis morning, I discussed our journey on NYSE interview. You can watch the full conversation here starting at 11:07: \nhttps://lnkd.in/erefxDmx \n\nScaling from startup to scale-up isn’t a straight line. It’s messy. It tests your culture.\nOurs: always iterating, always reinventing, always leaning into the growth pain.\n\nAs CFO, this is the proudest moment: watching this crew keep heads down, rally to the challenge, rise to an insane bar - with smiles, positivity, and lifelong friendships built in this special place.\n\nIn my 4-year journey here, I’ve seen how a bold vision + a resilient team can drive outsized result! At this scale, growth isn’t luck. It’s engineered with discipline, instrumented with rigor, and fueled by passion.\n\nNext: how fast can ClickUp get to $1B ARR?\nHere’s to the next chapter, and to everyone who believes in making work radically more productive.\n\nExperience Convergence today:\nhttp://bit.ly/3JMZOUy",
          "author": {
            "public_identifier": "danzhangdz",
            "id": "ACoAAARq6dQBhJsuw3EYWcZw3VPDnm5UUZ7u_BY",
            "name": "Dan Zhang",
            "is_company": false
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "POST",
        "provider": "LINKEDIN",
        "social_id": "urn:li:ugcPost:7371187572544327681",
        "share_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/christorbert_clickup-just-blew-past-300m-arr-but-were-activity-7371187573093879808-ukxE?utm_source=social_share_send&utm_medium=member_desktop_web&rcm=ACoAAAb5xloBAjquIMcq59NNupJ6dxbXVTCmLWk",
        "date": "10mo",
        "comment_counter": 0,
        "impressions_counter": 0,
        "reaction_counter": 13,
        "repost_counter": 0,
        "permissions": {
          "can_post_comments": true,
          "can_react": true,
          "can_share": true
        },
        "text": "Exciting milestone on the way to $1B+ ARR.  The future is bright!",
        "mentions": [],
        "attachments": [],
        "author": {
          "public_identifier": "christorbert",
          "id": "ACoAAAkcZs0BcrQPOIrLdT0I_BKDUWn2gANgRms",
          "name": "Chris Torbert",
          "is_company": false,
          "headline": "Sr. Director, Enterprise Sales @ ClickUp",
          "profile_picture_url": "https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D35AQHg9euoBFslqA/profile-framedphoto-shrink_200_200/B4DZ1Ok6wuH4AY-/0/1775139794323?e=1785510000&v=beta&t=UzrtKKdJEYjw-vMKGFR3wcXMsZ9jgfOVSIbf4l3T_SE"
        },
        "id": "7371187572544327681",
        "is_repost": true,
        "repost_id": "7371187573093879808",
        "parsed_datetime": "2025-09-09T14:27:47.337Z",
        "repost_content": {
          "id": "7371180996961976320",
          "date": "10mo",
          "parsed_datetime": "2025-09-09T14:01:39.596Z",
          "text": "ClickUp just blew past $300M ARR. But we're not just celebrating a number.\n\nWe're stopping to celebrate the entire journey - before we move the goal post again.\n\nAnd this journey has been nothing short of extraordinary. We’ve grown from a small team with a huge dream into a global company helping 20M+ people maximize their productivity.\n\n7 years ago, we set out with an ambitious vision.\n\nWe built ClickUp to end the chaos of work sprawl and converge many software categories together. We started when \"one app\" was seen as the wrong strategy, but today it's the only strategy to realize our mission of making people more productive.\n\nBecause 100% context is the single most important thing for enabling human productivity from AI.\n\nSo, this milestone? We stop. We breathe. We practice gratitude. We celebrate.\n\nTo our customers: Thank you so much for believing in us, and for sticking with us through growing pains.\n\nTo our teams: I'm infinitely grateful for how much you care, it energizes me to keep going every single day.\n\nWe’re just getting started. Thank you to everyone who’s been part of this story. 💜",
